            "review_title": "Review at Nisa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "faizah_wazir\nMelaka, Malaysia9 contributions\n0\nNot like before.\nDec 2015\nMy family and I have been there in mid November 2013. The owner is very friendly and helpful. The restaurant served delicious foods. No alcoholic drinks sold in the restaurant. We have a good chat with the owner who is a pious Muslim over \"teh tarik\". In early December 2015, my family and I again visited the Nisa Restaurant. The name has been changed to \"Little India\". Alcoholic drinks were display prominently. The so called \"briyani rice\" is nothing more than soggy rice mixed with tomato sauce. \"Teh tarik\" no longer in the menu.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 1, 2016",
            "rating": 1.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
