            "review_text": "Daro2\nEdinburgh, United Kingdom106 contributions\n0\nExcellent menu, great food\nNov 2013 • Friends\nNow called Little India, this restaurant had a diverse menu (written in English), including a large vegetarian section. 4 of us were very pleased with our meal. The service was good, and the place was clearly overseen by a short Indian man who swung by our table, made sure our meal was good, and asked us where we were all from. The atmosphere was okay. (A little music would have been nice, and distracted from the city and kitchen sounds). \nHighly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2013",
