            "review_text": "norizz\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia4 contributions\n0\nrestaurant with halal food\nJun 2013 • Friends\ni went to nisa restaurant for lunch on my first day in hanoi. unfortunately they closed (its 3 pm). i ended up going back to hotel. do some info search on the internet. n ask the hotel ladies about any other option of halal food. but not much choice. so we have to go back to nisa. n its open. luckily to relief hunger. we do not know they closed in the afternoon. so better go after 5 pm - till nite. \n\ndid try to find another halal restaurant similar to malaysian taste. but did'nt find the restaurant as stated in the website. it maybe closed down. what a waste money on taxi just to move around n found nothing. choose nisa for your convenience\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 6, 2013",
