            "review_title": "Review at Nisa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Shikin_Hamid\nSingapore, Singapore10 contributions\n0\nThe only Halal good food place\nMay 2013\nIt was quite difficult finding Halal food in Hanoi. This restaurant was the only food place we knew that serves Halal food.\n\nWe wanted to try another restaurant on our 2nd night but unfortunately the restaurant have been closed down. So we went back to Nisa Restaurant.\n\nI must agree the Pho is good. The staff are friendly and quick too. On our 2nd night dinner there, it was raining heavily. Staffs willingly sheltered us to the taxi. \n\nGreat service staff. Will recommend this place to other friends travelling to Hanoi in future.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 3, 2013",
